{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q3790542","formula":"C₂₃H₂₀N₂O₃S","hill":"C23H20N2O3S","elements":["H","C","N","O","S"],"composition":{"C":23.0,"H":20.0,"N":2.0,"O":3.0,"S":1.0},"names":{"en":"Sulfinpyrazone","ru":"Сульфинпиразон"},"descriptions":{"en":"Sulfinpyrazone is a uricosuric medication used to treat gout. It also sometimes is used to reduce platelet aggregation by inhibiting degranulation of platelets which reduces the release of ADP and thromboxane. Like other uricosurics, sulfinpyrazone works by competitively inhibiting uric acid reabsorption in the proximal tubule of the kidney.","ru":"Сульфинпиразон — урикозурический препарат, который используют для лечения подагры. Препарат усиливает выделение через почки мочевой кислоты. Снижая реабсорбцию мочевой кислоты в проксимальных канальцах нефрона, усиливает её выведение почками, особенно в первой стадии лечения."},"fame":15,"pubchemCid":5342,"mass":404.5,"charge":0,"smiles":"C1=CC=C(C=C1)N2C(=O)C(C(=O)N2C3=CC=CC=C3)CCS(=O)C4=CC=CC=C4","inchikey":"MBGGBVCUIVRRBF-UHFFFAOYSA-N","iupac":"4-[2-(benzenesulfinyl)ethyl]-1,2-diphenylpyrazolidine-3,5-dione","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"5342","atoms":49,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":3.615,"y":-1.737,"z":0.682,"el":"S"},{"x":-1.081,"y":-3.192,"z":-0.018,"el":"O"},{"x":-0.072,"y":0.097,"z":3.211,"el":"O"},{"x":4.239,"y":-1.251,"z":1.953,"el":"O"},{"x":-1.679,"y":-0.902,"z":0.253,"el":"N"},{"x":-1.286,"y":0.109,"z":1.163,"el":"N"},{"x":-0.341,"y":-1.897,"z":1.879,"el":"C"},{"x":1.136,"y":-2.233,"z":1.778,"el":"C"},{"x":-1.04,"y":-2.114,"z":0.557,"el":"C"},{"x":-0.555,"y":-0.443,"z":2.227,"el":"C"},{"x":1.843,"y":-1.335,"z":0.772,"el":"C"},{"x":-2.844,"y":-0.835,"z":-0.57,"el":"C"},{"x":-1.238,"y":1.5,"z":0.846,"el":"C"},{"x":-3.046,"y":-1.782,"z":-1.578,